text:
Non believers sold $ARC at bottom
@ARCreactorAI about to rip to new highs

@IncomeSharks great catch

> [@IncomeSharks](https://twitter.com/IncomeSharks):
> $ARC - Nice to see it breaking out after a six month consolidation period. Public team with some big names working for them (ex Forbes CCO and a CMO that's taken two companies public). Real world AI applications that are seeing interest from enterprises like IBM and Capgemini

+44.37% on base:0x2b31d3ed065f1f834d5c85efed49089f4c4f6b07.

@mucitradez shared the long inside @WealthGroup at $1,547 before price pushed through both targets and the trade closed in profit.

You don't need to find every opportunity yourself when you're surrounded by people looking for them with you.
